From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GDmio <zhalin66@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 04:49:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 17/32] BlueOS: SystemUI: Widgets 0.6

- Shared style: card transparency from the Secure setting
  blueos_widget_transparency (Wallpaper & style), applied as the alpha of a
  card layer; SystemUI watches it and the wallpaper colors and tells the
  Clock, Calendar and Gallery widgets (WIDGET_STYLE_CHANGED).
- Music: layouts by size (2x1, 2x2 art, strip, big art with progress,
  live elapsed time and controls) on the accent card, the user's font;
  play with no session resumes the last player.
- Equalizer widgets (bars, halo, wave, player) with BlueOSVisualizerView;
  BlueOSVisualizerService captures the output mix only for the default
  home app and only while a visible, playing widget is attached.
- Battery: 1x1 ring up to the big one, resizable, time until full.
- Summary: greeting to Sensei, date, next event or alarm, no card.
- Quick toggles: flashlight, do not disturb, auto-rotate, dark theme,
  battery saver.
- One row by default: the 6a's launcher cells are tall.

Change-Id: I1066ea836054bac0b377cf52e00b5da3ce0b4832
